om/photo/135372933.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/green-card-lottery-judge-freezes-reopening-of-diversity-visa-program-for-2027-what-happens-next/articleshow/135372933.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/green-card-lottery-judge-freezes-reopening-of-diversity-visa-program-for-2027-what-happens-next/articleshow/135372933.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-31T00:05:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135374928,imgsize-44646.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[New York appeals court blocks tenants' $321,728 mould damage claim over delays and missing proof]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135374631.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Recently, a New York appeals court dismissed further claims from tenants regarding property damage in their ongoing case. The court determined that the tenants significantly postponed presenting evidence for their $321,728.79 claim linked to health problems from mould exposure, which initially surfaced in 2018. Adding such claims post-discovery was seen as prejudicial to the landlord, but the case will continue with original personal injury allegations.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/new-york-tenants-pursuing-a-mould-lawsuit-later-sought-to-add-a-property-damage-claim-listed-at-321728-79-an-appeals-court-has-blocked-the-amendment-over-delay-missing-records-and-prejudice-to-the-landlord/articleshow/135374631.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/new-york-tenants-pursuing-a-mould-lawsuit-later-sought-to-add-a-property-damage-claim-listed-at-321728-79-an-appeals-court-has-blocked-the-amendment-over-delay-missing-records-and-prejudice-to-the-landlord/articleshow/135374631.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-31T00:04:35+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135374875,imgsize-2096221.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Kate Winslet joins Storyline Online, reads Room On The Broom]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135368682.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In a delightful initiative by Storyline Online, Kate Winslet recently narrated 'Room on the Broom,' a whimsical story that encourages literacy among children. Featuring a witch and her feline companion, the tale emphasizes themes of generosity and camaraderie, perfect for the Halloween spirit. Winslet's animated narration captivates young audiences, making reading a joy. With various celebrities contributing, Storyline Online provides a treasure trove of literature for families and schools alike.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/kate-winslet-reads-room-on-the-broom-for-children-during-the-halloween-season-adding-its-104th-read-aloud-to-storyline-onlines-free-literacy-library/articleshow/135368682.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/kate-winslet-reads-room-on-the-broom-for-children-during-the-halloween-season-adding-its-104th-read-aloud-to-storyline-onlines-free-literacy-library/articleshow/135368682.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-30T23:51:24+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135368759,imgsize-112582.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[UK woman claimed hip pain stopped her working, but ran piercing business]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" s