lver-airship-shaped-cabin-became-one-of-scotlands-most-unusual-holiday-rentals-now-airship-002-and-two-neighbouring-retreats-a-business-grossing-around-100000-a-year-are-listed-for-over-750000/articleshow/135366238.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-30T22:58:55+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135366629,imgsize-118807.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[New York’s High Line to Open Final Garden Featuring 2,000 Perennials in November]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135365105.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[This November, New York City's High Line will unveil its final garden at West 34th Street, culminating a transformative journey from an old freight line to a vibrant public park. Boasting 2,000 perennials alongside newly paved pathways and informative signage, this garden is distinctive in its grounded plantings. When finished, the High Line will welcome millions of annual visitors to enjoy its beauty and tranquility.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1933-new-yorks-high-line-carried-freight-trains-above-manhattan-after-its-conversion-into-a-park-visited-by-six-million-people-a-year-the-final-garden-with-2000-perennials-is-set-to-open-in-november/articleshow/135365105.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1933-new-yorks-high-line-carried-freight-trains-above-manhattan-after-its-conversion-into-a-park-visited-by-six-million-people-a-year-the-final-garden-with-2000-perennials-is-set-to-open-in-november/articleshow/135365105.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-30T22:57:20+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135366094,imgsize-2